# clang-tidy configuration for wicant-i-precondition firmware.
#
# Sources are C (gnu17) compiled by xtensa-elf-gcc; clang-tidy runs against
# a clang-native compilation database (ESP-IDF pyclang + esp-clang) and only
# analyzes this repo's sources under main/ and components/.
#
# Bug-finding and readability checks that catch real problems in embedded C.
# The big noise sources are disabled on purpose: every sprintf/strcpy in the
# firmware trips security.insecureAPI.* (~200 findings), and the optin module
# is host-oriented. If a check fires too often in code you own, prefer a
# targeted suppression (// NOLINT, or a per-check exclusion below) over turning
# off the whole family.
#
# Three families disabled after an audit of all their findings (2026-08):
# - readability-misleading-indentation: upstream code mixes tabs/spaces in
#   brace-delimited if/else chains; all findings were false-positive style
#   noise (no dangle-else). Existing sites were fixed in code; the check stays
#   off so future upstream merges don't flood the gate.
# - bugprone-implicit-widening-of-multiplication-result: every instance is a
#   small constant (20*1000, 1000*1000, ...) multiplied in int and compared to
#   an int64_t timer value; none can overflow in practice.
# - bugprone-multi-level-implicit-pointer-conversion: every instance is a
#   FreeRTOS xQueue* call passing &frame (const twai_frame_t **) where the
#   macro signature takes void*; inherent to the API, not fixable at the
#   call site.
Checks: >-
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  -readability-misleading-indentation,
  readability-redundant-control-flow,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-implicit-widening-of-multiplication-result,
  -bugprone-multi-level-implicit-pointer-conversion,
  -bugprone-narrowing-conversions,
  -bugprone-switch-missing-default-case,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.*,
  -clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.*,
  -misc-include-cleaner,
  -portability-restrict-system-includes,

WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: ''
FormatStyle: none
User: ''
CheckOptions: { }
